      "description": "ช่องค้นหาในคิว",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"5.5\"/><path d=\"m13 13 4 4\"/></svg><input type=\"search\" aria-label=\"ค้นหาทะเบียน\" placeholder=\"ค้นหาชื่อ หรือ Pet ID\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{position:relative;display:block;max-width:300px;color:#756354}.ds-search svg{position:absolute;left:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);height:16px;width:16px;pointer-events:none}.ds-search input{font-family:\"Noto Sans Thai\",Tahoma,sans-serif;box-sizing:border-box;appearance:none;width:100%;padding:10px 40px 10px 36px;border:1px solid #ddcdbc;border-radius:10px;background:#fffaf4;color:#392e28;font-size:13px;line-height:1.625}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:#756354}.ds-search input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #c64f29;outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-search input{min-height:44px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Checkbox",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "checkbox",
      "description": "native semantics กับ checkmark ของระบบ",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-check\"><span><input type=\"checkbox\" checked/><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4 10 4 4 8-8\"/></svg></span>ตรวจตัวสัตว์แล้ว</label>",
      "css": ".ds-check{font-family:\"Noto Sans Thai\",Tahoma,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:13px;color:#392e28}.ds-check>span{position:relative;display:inline-flex;width:20px;height:20px}.ds-check input{appearance:none;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;width:20px;height:20px;padding:0;border:1px solid #a38b76;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer}.ds-check input:checked{background:#c64f29;border-color:#c64f29}.ds-check svg{position:absolute;left:2px;top:2px;width:16px;height:16px;color:#fff;pointer-events:none;opacity:0}.ds-check input:checked+svg{opacity:1}.ds-check input:hover{border-color:#c64f29}.ds-check input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #c64f29;outline-offset:4px;}.ds-check input:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}"
    },
    {
